<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<preface xml:id="preface-introduction-student" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Introduction</title>
  <image source="diaMuertos-musicos-examples.png" width="60%" decorative="yes">
  </image>
  <p>
    Let's celebrate Día de los Muertos and make it alive by exploring counting concepts and playing interesting games!
  </p>

  <paragraphs>
    <title>Overview</title>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-celebrations" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's learn about Día de los Muertos, share similar celebrations, and take part in the celebration in a respectful way.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-los-musicos" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's have a celebration with musicians and invite as many as we can. Can we count them all?</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-more-counting" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's challenge ourselves more with counting situations and discover general principles.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-sets-among-us" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's form sets with special conditions by focusing on aspects in which we all agree, or we all disagree!</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <title><xref ref="chap-game-of-set" text="title"/></title>
        <p>Let's play the game of SET, and discover some of the math behind it!</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </paragraphs>

  <objectives>
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
  </objectives>

